# For the Black Monks dumps, whose loader has no language menu or data-disk prompt: the title,
# a click, a text prompt that takes Return, then the first game screen (docs/dumps.md, "Black
# Monks"). Sprites off, one shot with the same name as earth-base.input's.
until colours 16
wait 50
click
until colours 5
wait 50
key return
until colours 18 6000
wait 100
sprites off
wait 2
shot earth-base-nosprite
quit
